    website: https://hoffresearch.com
abstract: >-
  Build pipeline for the 3char dataset. It contains 64 parsers that read code systems, symbol sets and
  vocabularies from documented reference sources and write one Parquet file per system in a common schema, together with
  per-system provenance, a license triage, a regular expression enforced at build time, checksums of
  every raw source, and the scripts that reproduce the statistics in the dataset card. Cite the dataset
  itself separately, as described in its card.
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/brennercruvinel/3char-pipeline
url: https://huggingface.co/datasets/brennercruvinel/3char
keywords:
